Z||000011||terryk||07-06-2000||10:24 PM||||Maybe this is a better question...<P>Did it *ever* run right or has it done this all along?<P>Unless someone did some substantial ECM reprogramming that ECM is going to go through the motions of shifting a 4T65E trans and it won't get any of the feedback it expects.<P>||||reg||1
